{% extends 'user/Academics/program_detail.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Bachelor of Multimedia Arts{% endblock %}
{% block default_hero_image %}images/Academics/bma.jpg{% endblock %}

{% block overview_default %}
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg mb-6">
                            The Bachelor in Multimedia Arts (BMA) program aligns itself to the rapid convergence of media technologies and practices by developing conceptual, technical, aesthetic, and professional competencies for effective, critical and innovative storytelling across a range or combination of media forms for various purposes.
                        </p>

                        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg mb-6">
                            The BMA program is designed to respond to the requirement in the discipline for graduates to be familiar to a wide range of media forms and to provide the theoretical foundations and practical experience to develop skills in creative storytelling and expression for various purposes and contexts.
                        </p>

                        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
                           The goal of the BMA program is to develop within students the knowledge and skills that will enable them to communicate effectively, critically, and creatively across a range of new media technologies and forms, and to develop multimedia projects for various purposes.
                        </p>
{% endblock %}

